Input: stmfts - restore FTS5 after system suspend

System suspend switches off the controller even while an input device
is open. Restore FTS5 controller interrupts and active scanning before
enabling the Linux IRQ after reset. Release contacts before removing
power and send the sleep command before asserting reset.

Track regulator ownership independently of whether the controller is
ready. Roll back failed system suspend and keep runtime PM suspended
if initialization fails, so a later resume can retry the full sequence.

